@cc [owner:id13,label:api] private-event-transport
Private event endpoints for conversations, messages, Frame invocations, and sandbox-function
invocations MUST accept `transport=poll` on `/events` and return JSON event batches. Omitting
`transport` or using `transport=sse` MUST preserve SSE responses. Both transports MUST preserve
access checks and resume from `lastEventId`.

@cc [owner:id13,label:api;logging] event-transport-streaming-tag
Event polling responses MUST NOT set the request or trace `streaming` tag to true. SSE responses
MUST set both tags to true when initializing SSE headers. This applies to private MCP requests
and retained polling compatibility routes as well as event endpoints.
